    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You channel fel magic into your eyes. When you cast the spell, and as a Magic action on each of your later turns for the duration, you can unleash a blast of it: each creature in a 15-foot Cone makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 Force damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2.</p>",
